@startuml
participant NilaiService as Service
participant NilaiEvaluasiModel as EvalModel
participant PemetaanKomposisiCpmk as MapKompos
participant NilaiCpmkMahasiswa as CpmkModel
participant PemetaanCplCpmk as MapCpl
participant RekapCplMahasiswa as RekapModel
database DB

Service -> EvalModel: findAll({ kelasId })
EvalModel --> Service: nilaiPerMahasiswa
Service -> MapKompos: findAll({ komposisiIds })
Service -> CpmkModel: for each mahasiswa compute nilai CPMK menggunakan mapping komposisi
CpmkModel -> DB: insert/update nilai_cpmk_mahasiswa
Service -> MapCpl: findAll({ cpmkIds })
Service -> RekapModel: aggregate CPL per mahasiswa (weighted)
RekapModel -> DB: insert/update rekap_cpl_mahasiswa
Service --> Caller: summary hasil perhitungan

note right: Perhitungan harus memperhatikan bobot komponen,
pemetaan komposisi->CPMK, dan bobot CPMK->CPL.
@enduml
